{
  "title": "Pokemon Europe: Eclipse",
  "chapters": [
    {
      "city": "Oxford",
      "country": "England",
      "level": 6,
      "opponent": "RIVAL",
      "kind": "rival",
      "before": "ADA: Welcome to the European League. Your rival believes strength means never needing help. Show them what a partner can do. The station porter will open the next journey after your match.",
      "after": "{RIVAL}: You won. A League courier vanished near Paris. I am going after the badges, but I will keep an eye out. First, earn your badge here.",
      "trainer": 100
    },
    {
      "city": "London",
      "country": "England",
      "level": 12,
      "opponent": "ELLIS",
      "kind": "gym",
      "before": "ELLIS: Eight countries host our League challenge. Rock is your first test. Team ECLIPSE calls frightened POKEMON powerful. We call that cruelty.",
      "after": "ELLIS: The BOULDERBADGE is yours. Take the ferry to France. Find ADA's missing courier before ECLIPSE does.",
      "trainer": 108,
      "tm_reward": 39,
      "tm_reward_flag": "0x8c6"
    },
    {
      "city": "Paris",
      "country": "France",
      "level": 17,
      "opponent": "MARINE",
      "kind": "gym",
      "before": "MARINE: The courier left a sealed research ledger. ECLIPSE stole its key and abandoned a PIKACHU whose heart is closed. Win this match, then meet our rescue keeper.",
      "after": "MARINE: The CASCADEBADGE is yours. The ledger names Brussels. Take the rescued partner with you if you can. Care opens what force cannot.",
      "trainer": 116,
      "tm_reward": 3,
      "tm_reward_flag": "0x8c7"
    },
    {
      "city": "Brussels",
      "country": "Belgium",
      "level": 21,
      "opponent": "SABINE",
      "kind": "gym",
      "before": "SABINE: ECLIPSE buys League freight permits to move stolen partners. Our garden shelter intercepted one shipment. Prove your bond before I entrust you with its manifest.",
      "after": "SABINE: You earned the RAINBOWBADGE. The manifest leads to Amsterdam. Their director VEIL funds the machines through a shipping company.",
      "trainer": 124,
      "tm_reward": 9,
      "tm_reward_flag": "0x8c8"
    },
    {
      "city": "Amsterdam",
      "country": "Netherlands",
      "level": 25,
      "opponent": "MAARTEN",
      "kind": "gym",
      "before": "MAARTEN: VEIL's machines use a signal that suppresses emotion. Your rival chased a freighter without waiting for us. Earn the THUNDERBADGE, then find them in Berlin.",
      "after": "MAARTEN: The THUNDERBADGE is yours. ECLIPSE stole an archive from Berlin. ADA thinks the signal is much older than this company.",
      "trainer": 132,
      "tm_reward": 34,
      "tm_reward_flag": "0x8c9"
    },
    {
      "city": "Berlin",
      "country": "Germany",
      "level": 29,
      "opponent": "GRETA",
      "kind": "gym",
      "before": "GRETA: Our archive preserves the work of people who resisted the Nazi regime. Someone stole a wartime laboratory file. German resistance members risked everything to protect their neighbors. Help us protect that memory.",
      "after": "GRETA: The SOULBADGE is yours. Your birthplace never decides your loyalties. ADA traced the stolen file to Prague. The resistance names in it must remain protected.",
      "trainer": 140,
      "tm_reward": 31,
      "tm_reward_flag": "0x8ca"
    },
    {
      "city": "Prague",
      "country": "Czechia",
      "level": 32,
      "opponent": "ECLIPSE",
      "kind": "enemy",
      "before": "ADA: ECLIPSE is testing a shadow transmitter in the old freight yard. Your rival tried to destroy it alone and was captured. Defeat the handler and bring everyone out together.",
      "after": "{RIVAL}: I thought asking for help meant losing. You came anyway. The receiver points to Vienna. From now on we do this together.",
      "trainer": 148
    },
    {
      "city": "Vienna",
      "country": "Austria",
      "level": 35,
      "opponent": "IRENA",
      "kind": "gym",
      "before": "IRENA: The signal can be unmade, but its original frequency is missing. My psychic partners hear a frightened voice inside it. Earn the MARSHBADGE; then we can search the Swiss archive.",
      "after": "IRENA: The MARSHBADGE is yours. The archive's keeper in Zurich has a clock that reacts to CELEBI. ECLIPSE is trying to use it to reach the past.",
      "trainer": 156,
      "tm_reward": 4,
      "tm_reward_flag": "0x8cb"
    },
    {
      "city": "Zurich",
      "country": "Switzerland",
      "level": 37,
      "opponent": "VEIL",
      "kind": "enemy",
      "before": "VEIL: Fear creates obedient partners. CELEBI will take me to the original machine, and this time nobody will stop its broadcast. Your sentimental League is already obsolete.",
      "after": "ADA: VEIL escaped with the clock's core. We recovered its map. It names Rome, Madrid and a final shipping point in Lisbon. CELEBI is following the damage to time.",
      "trainer": 164
    },
    {
      "city": "Rome",
      "country": "Italy",
      "level": 40,
      "opponent": "FLAVIA",
      "kind": "gym",
      "before": "FLAVIA: ECLIPSE recruits trainers by promising instant strength. My partners grew through years of trust. The VOLCANOBADGE belongs to someone who understands that difference.",
      "after": "FLAVIA: The VOLCANOBADGE is yours. A League ranger intercepted VEIL's message to Madrid. They plan to erase the people who stopped the original experiments.",
      "trainer": 172,
      "tm_reward": 50,
      "tm_reward_flag": "0x8cc"
    },
    {
      "city": "Madrid",
      "country": "Spain",
      "level": 43,
      "opponent": "INES",
      "kind": "gym",
      "before": "INES: This is your eighth challenge. The EARTHBADGE will qualify you for Athens, but first there are lives to protect. ECLIPSE's ship is leaving Lisbon with the clock core.",
      "after": "INES: All eight badges! The League can wait. Your rival has found a harbor path in Lisbon. Stop the ship before VEIL can reopen the past.",
      "trainer": 180,
      "tm_reward": 26,
      "tm_reward_flag": "0x8cd"
    },
    {
      "city": "Lisbon",
      "country": "Portugal",
      "level": 45,
      "opponent": "ECLIPSE",
      "kind": "enemy",
      "before": "{RIVAL}: We will cut the harbor power together. You draw the handler out; I will stop the transmitter. CELEBI is here. Something on that ship is tearing a hole in time.",
      "after": "ADA: CELEBI opened a path to 1940. We can stop VEIL's fictional shadow experiment and protect its victims. We cannot erase the real war. CELEBI will always offer a way home.",
      "trainer": 188
    },
    {
      "city": "Paris1940",
      "country": "France, 1940",
      "level": 46,
      "opponent": "PATROL",
      "kind": "nazi",
      "before": "MIREILLE: Nazi occupation forces seized our partners for a secret experiment. We are the resistance. Drive off this patrol so our courier can reach a safe house. CELEBI waits beside the return guide.",
      "after": "MIREILLE: The courier is safe. Her message names a transfer to Warsaw in 1943. CELEBI can follow the clock's echoes. Our struggle is for people and their partners, never for a flag.",
      "trainer": 196
    },
    {
      "city": "Warsaw1943",
      "country": "Poland, 1943",
      "level": 48,
      "opponent": "WARDEN",
      "kind": "nazi",
      "before": "ZOFIA: The underground is moving families away from a fictional research depot. Disable its shadow controller while we open the exit. The real occupation and persecution were human crimes. Our rescue changes this invented operation only.",
      "after": "ZOFIA: Everyone in the safe house has a route out. The machine's designer moved to Berlin. LENA, a German resistance courier, can get you into its service wing in 1944.",
      "trainer": 203
    },
    {
      "city": "Berlin1944",
      "country": "Germany, 1944",
      "level": 50,
      "opponent": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "nazi",
      "before": "LENA: I work inside the laboratory for the resistance. Your cover is a repair courier. If you started in Germany, your local knowledge helps us verify the papers. Once inside, refuse their orders and disable the machine. I will evacuate the partners.",
      "after": "LENA: The controller is destroyed. VEIL stole a copy, but we kept the names of the resistance out of his hands. We helped this rescue succeed. The war still has its real history. Go home and stop him.",
      "trainer": 210
    },
    {
      "city": "Geneva",
      "country": "Switzerland",
      "level": 52,
      "opponent": "VEIL",
      "kind": "enemy",
      "before": "VEIL: I brought the shadow frequency back. One broadcast will close every heart in the League. Your rival has shut the outer relays, but you will not reach the core.",
      "after": "ADA: It is over. The broadcast is broken; the rescued partners can heal. The archive will preserve the resistance accounts with care. Your rival is waiting in Athens. Finish the journey you began.",
      "trainer": 217
    },
    {
      "city": "Athens",
      "country": "Greece",
      "level": 54,
      "opponent": "THALIA",
      "kind": "elite",
      "before": "THALIA: Welcome to the European League. Eight badges and the freedom of your partners brought you here. Four council members stand between you and the final rival match. Begin with ice.",
      "after": "THALIA: First council match complete. Heal and rest if you need to. NIKOS is waiting at the next chamber.",
      "trainer": 224
    },
    {
      "city": "Athens2",
      "country": "Greece",
      "level": 55,
      "opponent": "NIKOS",
      "kind": "elite",
      "before": "NIKOS: Strength is what you choose to protect. My fighting team will test how you turn that choice into action.",
      "after": "NIKOS: You passed. ELENI studies the fears that remain after a battle. She is your next opponent.",
      "trainer": 231
    },
    {
      "city": "Athens3",
      "country": "Greece",
      "level": 56,
      "opponent": "ELENI",
      "kind": "elite",
      "before": "ELENI: Darkness is not a fault in a partner. A closed heart is an injury. Our ghost and psychic teams have learned to trust again. Show me your team's courage.",
      "after": "ELENI: Your partners know you will stay with them. LEON waits in the dragon chamber.",
      "trainer": 238
    },
    {
      "city": "Athens4",
      "country": "Greece",
      "level": 57,
      "opponent": "LEON",
      "kind": "elite",
      "before": "LEON: You have crossed countries and centuries. One last council match. Do not mistake a powerful partner for a tool.",
      "after": "LEON: The council recognizes you. Your rival reached the champion's chamber first. Go meet them as equals.",
      "trainer": 245
    },
    {
      "city": "Champion",
      "country": "Greece",
      "level": 60,
      "opponent": "RIVAL",
      "kind": "champion",
      "before": "{RIVAL}: I used to think a champion stood alone. Now I know who helped me get here. No secrets, no stolen strength. One honest match between us. Ready?",
      "after": "{RIVAL}: You are the EUROPEAN CHAMPION! ADA records our journey: eight badges, partners rescued, a resistance network protected, and ECLIPSE defeated. CELEBI returns to its forest. The shelters remain open. We will keep traveling together. THE END.",
      "trainer": 252
    }
  ],
